  <p>
    This is a gift from my good friend Görkem Tanca. He has an industrial workshop, where he creates
    beautiful objects out of thin wood by laser cutting and laser burning. I don't know why, but I
    always loved the spade shape. On top of this, it's on wood!
  </p>
